      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree we need some sort of limit, but TWO meshes? I think that's too strict. My avatar has two-three meshes for the body, but then if I want to add toggleable objects like guns or sunglasses, those are one more mesh each. The 8 materials limit seems fine to me and leaves a lot of room, but only 2 meshes doesn't seem a good idea to me, at all. The limit should be around 8 as well, in my opinion.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
